1. Start Docker infrastructure (Postgres + RabbitMQ)
cd backend
npm run infra:up

2. Start the backend API (Terminal 1)
cd backend
npm run start:dev

3. Start the backend Worker (Terminal 2 — separate, leave Terminal 1 running)
cd backend
npm run start:worker

4. Start the frontend (Terminal 3)
cd frontend/cooperative-web
npm install
npm run dev

Build and testing:
cd backend
npm install
npx tsc --noEmit -p apps/api/tsconfig.app.json
npm run build
npx jest
npm run db:run

cd frontend/cooperative-web
npx tsc -b
npm run build